  data: {
    LLM: "Bid when you have good trump and point cards; avoid overbidding. Call a card you do not hold to find a partner.\n\nTrack which point cards have been played; infer partner when the called card appears. Lead trump to pull opponents' trumps when your side has length.\n\nOptimize the call to maximize chance your partner has the card; coordinate with partner through carding when identity is revealed.",
